    "detailed_description": "Dual-wield high tech weapons to fight off endless and increasingly difficult waves of enemies in this sci-fi VR shooter. Give it your best in an attempt to climb the leaderboards by reaching the highest score out of all players. <br><br>Features several different weapons and enemies along with randomly generated waves to make sure that no two games are the same.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Randomly generated waves with continuous increase in difficulty.<br></li><li>Multiple futuristic weapon types which change based on combo-multipliers.<br></li><li>A few different enemy types: Watch out for Kamikazes!<br></li><li>Easy to learn, challenging to master: Increase your highscore to climb the ranks!</li></ul>",
